  "question": {
    "text": "The oscillating magnetic field in a plane electromagnetic wave is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>1000</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>. The amplitude of electric field will be",
