  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>1000</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p>Here, peak value of magnetic&nbsp;field,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p>Now the speed of the wave&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Using relation between magnetic and electric field,&nbsp;</p><p>Peak value of electric&nbsp;field is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
